sequenceDiagram
    participant T as ExpirationScheduler
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant S as SettlementService
    participant E as EventPublisher
    T->>DB: databaseLock + transaction: expired OPEN/RUNNING -> FINISHED
    DB-->>T: commit
    T->>E: AUCTION_FINISHED
    T->>S: settle FINISHED (including retries)
    S->>DB: transaction: unique settlement, winner debit, seller credit, unlock funds
    alt settlement already recorded
        DB-->>S: existing settlement, no second payment
    else transfer committed
        DB-->>S: commit PAID and events
        S->>E: AUCTION_SETTLED then targeted BALANCE_CHANGED
    end
